<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">- NKANGALA New Testament Zambia</book>
  <para style="h">1Kolinte</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda uakulivanga ua Paulu kuli vaka Kolinte</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Kolinte</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Kol</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda uakulivanga ua Paulu kuli vaka</para>
  <para style="mt1">KOLINTE</para>
  <para style="imt">Citsindikisi</para>
  <para style="ip">Mukanda ua Kolinte uakulivanga vausonekele kuli kanganda Paulu hanima ya muaka makumi atanu na miaka itanu (55) hanima ya kusemuka ca Kilistu (1:1) Ou ukeuo mukanda uakulivanga ku mikanda ivali ije ituli nayo ije Paulu uasonekelele ku cikungulukilo ca mu Kolinte. Cilivene uasonekele ou mukanda tele ali mu Efeso tele kanda asinganieke via vungenzi vuendi vua kumenekela ku Kolinte mu ngila yendi tele ahuma ku Masendoniya 16:5-9.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ou mukanda uapuile cikumbulula ca vimpande vije viatambuile Paulu vije viahuminine ku vaka kukunguluka vamo vamu cikungulukilo ha viuma vije keti viacili vije vivakele nakulinga mu cikungulukilo, hamo na mahangununo na via vupangala. Nganda ya Kolinte vaizivukile cikuma ku viavupangala vuayo, nankuma keti cakukomouesa ngeci cije cikungulukilo kuje cakele na kuhita mu viuma evi. Kolinte uakulivanga naua uakala na kapetulu ua kutsimana mu via cizango 13</para>
  <para style="iot">Muvana utumbikilamo</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Paulu ameneka vaka Kolinte na kutsantsela kuli Njambi muomu yavo 1:1-9</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Ambahoni Paulu ahandeka ha vimpande vije viatambuile via mahangununo mu cikungulukilo ca Kolinte 1:10; 4:21</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Cakuhatako Paulu ahandeka ha viuma via vupangala na kulituala umo na mukuavo ku nzango 5; 6</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Hanima yevi Paulu ahana vishika ha vimpande via vulo, na kukombelela ku tumponia, na kulemesa mu vivunga, na mavuana aku cimbembesi na kusanguka ku vatsi 7-15</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Cakumanusuila Paulu amanusula na vilinga na vimpande viendi vavenia 16</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1" />Yange Paulu uje ivasanene ku cizango ca Njambi kupua kanganda ua Kilistu Yesu, njili na muanetu Sosetane.<verse eid="1CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2" />Njili nakusonekela ku cikungulukilo ca Njambi cije cili mu Kolinte, kuli vaje vanakundama kuli Kilistu Yesu, vaje vavasanene nguavo vantu va kulela va Njambi hamo na voshe vaje vali mu mitambela yoshe ije ikasana ha lizina lia Muene Yesu Kilistu, ikeye Muene uavo na Muene uetu.<verse eid="1CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3" />Kavumbi kakaleneni na ciyulo kuhuminina kuli Njambi Tatetu na Muene Yesu Kilistu.<verse eid="1CO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vikuisulo muli Kilistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4" />Ntsimbu yoshe njikahana citsantsela kuli Njambi, hali yeni muomu ya kavumbi ka Njambi kaje kavamihanene yeni muli Kilistu Yesu, <verse eid="1CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5" />linga mu viuma vioshe mupue vakupita muli ikeye na vihandeka vioshe na mana oshe, <verse eid="1CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6" />cipue vene vukaleho vua Kilistu vanavushulisisa hali yeni, <verse eid="1CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7" />ngeci keti muhonoue cimo mu vuana vua Cimbembesi, omo muli nakuvandamena cikuma kusholoka ca Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu, <verse eid="1CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8" />ikeye uje akamikolesa noho na kumamanusuilo, linga keti vaka miuane na mulonga ha litangua lia Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu. <verse eid="1CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9" />Njambi uapua ua kulongua uje muli ikeye vamisanene kupua vumo na munendi Yesu Kilistu Muene uetu.<verse eid="1CO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahangununo mu Cikungulukilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10" />Njimilambelela yeni vamuenetu, mu lizina lia Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu, ngeci yeni muva voshe mu litavasane kaha naua linga keti hakale mahangununo hakati keni, vuno honi linga mu litombole mu mana amo na viyongola vimo. <verse eid="1CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11" />Muomu vantu vaku Koloe vanacambulula kuli yange nguavo kuli kulicokota hakati keni vamuanetu. <verse eid="1CO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12" />Njilumbununa ngeci umo na umo ueni ahandeka nguendi, “Njakundama kuli Paulu,” cipue nguendi, “Njakundama kuli Apolo,” cipue nguendi “Njakundama kuli Kefase,” cipue nguendi “Njakundama kuli Kilistu.” <verse eid="1CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13" />Nkuma Kilistu vamutepe ndi? Nkuma Paulu vamushukikile muomu yeni ndi? Cipue nkuma vamimbuitikile mu lizina lia Paulu ndi? <verse eid="1CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14" />Njitsantsela ngeci kunjambuitikile cipue umo kuli yeni kuvanga lika Kilisipase na Ngayase, <verse eid="1CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15" />linga naumo uahi ase kuhandeka nguendi vamumbuitikile muli lizina liange. <verse eid="1CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16" />(Njambuitikile naua ntanga ya Setefanase. Kuhuma hali ava kunjizivuka indi njambuitikileho umo naua) <verse eid="1CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17" />Muomu Kilistu kanjitumine mukumbuitika vuno honi mukuambulula Muzimbu Uacili, keti na mana a vuntu, linga cilindakano ca Kilistu keti vacihuise nzili yaco.<verse eid="1CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilistu ikeye Nzili na Mana a Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18" />Muomu lizi lia cilindakano linapu lia vulema kuli vaje vananongo, vuno honi kuli yetu vaje vavanovola linapu nzili ya Njambi. <verse eid="1CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19" />Muomu vanacisoneka nguavo, “Njikanongesa mana a vaka kuzangama, nakuvuisisa ca vaka kulilongesa njikacipihisa.” <verse eid="1CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20" />Nkuma ali kuli yala ua mana? Nkuma ali kuli mulongisi? Nkuma ali kuli muka kulilongesa ua matangua ano? Nkuma Njambi kalingile mana a mavu ku apuisa vulema ndi? <verse eid="1CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21" />Hume laja mu mana a Njambi, mavu kazivukile Njambi kuhitila mu mana auo, mavu avuahelesele Njambi kuhitila mu viuma via ngoco vije vituambuluile mukuovola vaje vaka kutsiliela. <verse eid="1CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22" />Muomu Vayunda vakatondo vimueso kaha va Ngelengu vakatondo mana, <verse eid="1CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23" />vuno honi yetu tuambulula kushukika ca Kilistu ha cilindakano, livue lia kutsuntsuka kuli Vayunda kaha liapua lia vulema kuli vaje keti Vayunda, <verse eid="1CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24" />vuno honi kuli vaje vavanasana voshe Vayunda na va Ngelengu, Kilistu ikeye nzili ya Njambi na mana a Njambi. <verse eid="1CO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25" />Muomu vulema vua Njambi vunapu vua mana kupulakana vantu, na kuzeya ca Njambi cinapu ca nzili kupulakana vantu. <verse eid="1CO 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26" />Vamuanetu singaniekeni muje mumuafuile omo vamisanene, keti vuingi vueni vuoshe muapuile vaka mana kuya mucinafuilamo hano ha mavu, keti voshe vapuile va nzili, keti vuingi vuavo vasemukile muacili. <verse eid="1CO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27" />Vuno honi Njambi uahanguile via vulema ha mavu linga apayese vaka mana, naua Njambi uahanguile vije via kuzeya hano ha mavu linga apayese vaka nzili, <verse eid="1CO 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28" />Njambi uahanguile vije via kulikehesa na vije viakusembulula ha mavu, na viuma vije kuviesiko, linga ahonouese viuma vije vivanamono nguavo vili naseho kupua viangoco, <verse eid="1CO 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29" />linga keti muntu alihalese ku mesho a Njambi. <verse eid="1CO 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30" />Ikeye ntsina ya vuyoye vueni muli Kilistu Yesu, uje Njambi yanapuisa mana etu, vusunga vuetu, nakulela cetu na vuovoke vuetu, <verse eid="1CO 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31" />nankuma ngue muje muvanacisoneka nguavo, “Eceleni uoshe uje alihalesa, alihalesele muli Muene.”<verse eid="1CO 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2" />
  <para style="s">Muzimbu ua Kilistu uje ivashukikile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1" />Vamuanetu omo njezile kuli yeni, kunjezile nakuambulula kuli yeni vukaleho vua Njambi muku likuasesa mezi akama cipue mana. <verse eid="1CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2" />Muomu kunjatondele kuzivuka cipue cimo cahi hakati keni kuvanga lika Yesu Kilistu uje ivashukikile ha cilindakano. <verse eid="1CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3" />Kaha njakele neni mu kuzeya na mu liova cikuma na kujaja, <verse eid="1CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4" />kaha vihandeka viange na muzimbu uange kuviakele na mezi avutongue a mana, vuno honi na cimueso ca Cimbembesi ua nzili, <verse eid="1CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5" />ngeci linga lutsilielo lueni keti lukundame mu mana a vantu vuno honi mu nzili ya Njambi.<verse eid="1CO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mana a Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6" />Honi kuli vaje vanakolo mu mana tukahandeka navo mu mana, cipue vene keti mana a ntsimbu ino cipue a vaka kuyula va ntsimbu ino, vaje nzili yavo ikahua. <verse eid="1CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7" />Vuno honi tukahandeka vushueke na mana a Njambi akulishueka, aje Njambi nahangula muomu ya vumpau vuetu tele ntsimbu kanda mavu aputuke. <verse eid="1CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8" />Na umo uahi hali vaka kuyula va ntsimbu ino vovuisisile eci, nga vovuisisile ngue kuvashukikile Muene ua vumpau. <verse eid="1CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9" />Vuno honi ngue muje muvana visoneka mu visoneka nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">“Cije lisho ku liamuene cipue lituitui kulievuile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:9">cipue mutima ua muntu ku uasinganiekele nguavo cikalingiua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:9">vikevio vije Njambi navuahesela vaje vamuzanga,”<verse eid="1CO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10" />Njambi na tusholuela laja kuhitila mu Cimbembesi cendi. Muomu Cimbembesi akatondo viuma vioshe, cipue vene viuma viakulova via Njambi. <verse eid="1CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11" />Nkuma keti cimbembesi ua muntu uje ali muli ikeye, ikeye azivuka visinganieka viendi ndi? Nankuma mu ngila imo vene naumo uahi azivuka mana a Njambi kuvanga lika Cimbembesi ua Njambi. <verse eid="1CO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12" />Honi kutuatambuile cimbembesi ua mavu, vuno honi Cimbembesi uje ahuminina kuli Njambi, linga tuvuisise vuana vuanatuhana Njambi.<verse eid="1CO 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13" />Tuahandeka evi mu mezi aje keti akutulongesa ku mana a vuntu vuno honi ku mezi aje atualilongesele kuli Cimbembesi, kulumbununa vusunga vua ku cimbembesi kuli vaje vali na Cimbembesi. <verse eid="1CO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14" />Muntu uje uakuhona cimbembesi kekutambula mavuana a Cimbembesi ua Njambi, muomu anapu akuhona seho kuli ikeye, kaha kasa ku evuisisa muomu anapu aku Cimbembesi. <verse eid="1CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15" />Muntu uaku cimbembesi akasompo viuma vioshe, vuno honi ikeye naumo uahi asa kumusompa. <verse eid="1CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16" />Ngue muvihandeka visoneka nguavio,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:16">“Nkuma iya azivuka mana a Muene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:16">linga amushike?”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 2:16">Vuno honi tuli na mana a Kilistu.<verse eid="1CO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3" />
  <para style="s">Vangamba va Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1" />Vuno honi vamuanetu, kunjasele kuhandeka kuli yeni ngue vantu vaje vayoya mu cimbembesi, vuno honi ngue vantu vaje vayoya mu vuntu, ngue tukeke muli Kilistu. <verse eid="1CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2" />Njamilisile na mavele keti na via kulia via kukola, muomu tele kanda mucili vuaheselelevio, kaha cipue hano vene kanda mulivuahesele, <verse eid="1CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3" />muomu hanga mucili ku vuntu. Muomu nga hanga hakati keni ha cili cipululu na lifuua, nkuma keti yeni vaka mavu, vantu vaje vayoya kufutisi ya mavu ndi? <verse eid="1CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4" />Nkuma nga omo umo ahandeka nguendi, “Yange njakundama kuli Paulu,” kaha mukuavo nguendi, “Yange njakundama kuli Apolo,” Nkuma yeni keti mu vantu va mavu ndi?<verse eid="1CO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5" />Nkuma Apolo ikeye iya? Nkuma Paulu ikeye iya? Tu vangamba lika kuhitila muli uje imuatsilielele, kuya muje Muene uacihanene kuli umo na umo. <verse eid="1CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6" />Yange njakunine, kaha Apolo uetilile mema, vuno honi Njambi ikeye uakolesele. <verse eid="1CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7" />Nankuma muka kukuna cipue muka kuitilila na umo uahi ali naseho, vuno honi kuvanga lika Njambi uje muka kukolesa. <verse eid="1CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8" />Muka kukuna na muka kuitilila voshe vanalieseka. Kaha umo na umo akatambula fueto kuya kuvipangi viendi. <verse eid="1CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9" />Muomu tunapu vamo mu vipangi via kupangela Njambi, kaha yeni munapu lihia lia Njambi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 3:9">Naua munapu njivo ya Njambi. <verse eid="1CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10" />Kuya ku kavumbi kaje kanjihanene Njambi, ngue muka kutunga uavutongue njajalele luvula, kaha muntu ueka naua alinakutungilaho. Kaha muntu ueka napande kuzangama muje muatungilaho. <verse eid="1CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11" />Muomu nalumo luahi luvula lueka luje muntu asa kujalaho kupulakana luje luvanajala laja lukeluo Yesu Kilistu. <verse eid="1CO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12" />Honi nga muntu umo atunga haje ha luvula na ngolinde, na siliva, na mavue a seho cikuma, na viti na muila cipue na vishati, <verse eid="1CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13" />muntu na muntu vipangi viendi vikasholoka, muomu Litangua lia Muene lika visholola, muomu vikasholoka na tuhia, tuhia tukeseka cifua muka ca vipangi cije muntu na muntu napanga. <verse eid="1CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14" />Nga vipangi vije viatungile muntu na muntu uoshe ha luvula vili muacili, kaha akatambula vuana. <verse eid="1CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15" />Kaha nga vipangi via muntu na muntu uoshe vaka viuemeka, kaha nacimo cahi cakauanaho, cipue vene ikeye liavenia vaka muovola, vuno honi kuhitila lika ngue unaputumuka mu tuhia.<verse eid="1CO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16" />Nkuma yeni kumuazivukile ngeci muapua mu njivo ya Njambi, kaha ngeci Cimbembesi ua Njambi uakala muli yeni ndi? <verse eid="1CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17" />Nga muntu apihisa njivo ya Njambi, kaha na Njambi akamupihisa. Muomu njivo ya Njambi yapua lika ya kulela, kaha ije njivo ya Njambi ikeyo vene yeni.<verse eid="1CO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18" />Keti kukale muntu umo alikuise ikeye vavenia. Nga hakati keni hali umo asinganieka nguendi ali na mana a matangua ano, mueceleni apue cilema ngeci akapue ua mana. <verse eid="1CO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19" />Muomu mana a mavu ano apua a vulema kuli Njambi. Muomu vacisoneka nguavo, “Akakuata vaka mana mu kuzangama cavo,” <verse eid="1CO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20" />kaha naua nguavo, “Muene azivuka ngeci visinganieka via vaka mana viapua viangoco.” <verse eid="1CO 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21" />Nankuma keti kukale muntu cipue umo alihalese muomu ya vantu. Muomu viuma vioshe vinapu vieni, <verse eid="1CO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22" />cipue vene Paulu, cipue Apolo, cipue Kefase, cipue mavu, cipue muono, cipue kutsa, cipue ntsimbu ino, cipue kulutue, vioshe vinapu vieni, <verse eid="1CO 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23" />kaha yeni munapu vantu va Kilistu, kaha Kilistu napu ua Njambi.<verse eid="1CO 3:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4" />
  <para style="s">Tunganda va Kilistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1" />Omu mukemo muntu muanapande kutuambatelamo ngue vangamba va Kilistu, na vaka kuniunga vusueke vua Njambi. <verse eid="1CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2" />Kaha cuma cije citondeka cikuma kuli vakakuniunga ngeci vapue vantu vakulongua. <verse eid="1CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3" />Vuno honi kuli yange cinapu cuma ca cindende ngeci linga yeni munjisompe cipue na mpunga ili yoshe ya vantu. Cipue vene yange vavenia kunjekulisompa. <verse eid="1CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4" />Kunjizivukaho cipue cimo cije cakuliluisa naco yange vavenia, vuno honi cipue ngoco kucimuesa ngue kunjesi na mulonga. Vuno honi muene ikeye uje akanjisompo. <verse eid="1CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5" />Nankuma keti musompe ntsimbu kanda ihete, ntsimbu kanda Muene eje, uje akaneha ku ceke viuma vije hano vialisueke mu milima nakusholola mashungu a mutima. Ambahoni muntu ku muntu akatambula vije via mupande kuhuminina kuli Njambi. <verse eid="1CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6" />Njinalingi vioshe evi kuli yange vavenia na kuli Apolo muomu yeni, vamuanetu ngeci mulilongesele kuli yetu linga keti mupulakane vije vivanasoneka, ngeci keti kukale umo ueni alihalesele ku umo kaha asembulule mukuavo. <verse eid="1CO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7" />Nkuma iya akamona cuma ca kuliseza muli yeni? Vika muli navio vije kumuatambuile? Ambahoni nga muacitambuile, kaha vika mulihalesa ngue ku capuile vuana? <verse eid="1CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8" />Muli laja na viuma vioshe vimutonda! Kaha laja naua munapu vaka kufuka! Kuakuhona yetu munapu vimiene! Kaha munapande ngeci muyule, linga netu tuase kuyula neni! <verse eid="1CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9" />Muomu njiyongola ngeci Njambi natuhaka yetu tunganda ngue vakumanusuila ku voshe, ngue vaje vantu va vanasompela kutsa, tunapu cimueso ku vaka mavu, naku tungelo naku vantu. <verse eid="1CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10" />Tuvilema muomu ya Kilistu, vuno honi yeni mu vakuzangama muli Kilistu, yetu tuvakuzeya, vuno honi yeni muva kutakama. Yeni vamisingimika, vuno honi yetu vatushaula. <verse eid="1CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11" />Kuntsimbu ino tunatsi njala na kuvua mpuila, tuzala via kutavuozoka nakutuyandesa kaha kutuesi na membo, <verse eid="1CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12" />kaha tukapanga cikuma na mavoko etu vavenia. Omo vatusinga, yetu tukuisula, omo vatupakesa, yetu tutualelelaho kuimana ngoo, <verse eid="1CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13" />Kaha nga vatushaula, yetu tukeseka kulitavasana, tunapu kaha honi tunapu ngue vilinge via ngoco via ha mavu, kuviuma vioshe na kuntsimbu ino. <verse eid="1CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14" />Kunjasonekele eci ngeci yeni muvue shuamua, vuno honi mukuminangula ngue vana vaje vanjazanga. <verse eid="1CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15" />Kaha nga cipue vene muli navaka kuimanena vavengi vaje kuvasiua kuvatanda muli Kilistu, vuno honi kumuesi navaishueni vavengi. Muomu yange njapuile ishueni muli Kilistu Yesu kuhitila mu Muzimbu Uacili. <verse eid="1CO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16" />Ambahoni njimisindiya nguange pueni vaka kunjitemuinina. <verse eid="1CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17" />Nankuma njituma Timateo kuli yeni, muana uje injazanga uakulongua muli Muene, linga amianukisa vingila viange muli Kilistu, ngue muje munjika vilongeselamo kuoshe mu vikungulukilo vioshe.<verse eid="1CO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18" />Vamo vanapu vaka kulihalesa, nguevene kunjezile kuli yeni. <verse eid="1CO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19" />Vuno honi njili nakuija kuli yeni vuavuno, nga cizango ca Muene citava, kaha kunjikauana lika vihandeka via vantu ava vaka kulihalesa vuno honi nzili yavo. <verse eid="1CO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20" />Muomu Vumuene vua Njambi kuvuapuile lika mukuhandeka vuno honi na mu nzili. <verse eid="1CO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21" />Nkuma vika mutonda? Mutonda njije kuli yeni na likote indi na cizango mu cimbembesi ca kulikehesa?<verse eid="1CO 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5" />
  <para style="s">Vupangala mu Cikungulukilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1" />Vanacambulula vene nguavo kuli cikuma vupangala hakati keni, vuje cipue hakati ka vaje vakakuhona kutsiliela kuve kuvulinga, muomu muana ua yala alinga vupangala na mpuevo ya ishe. <verse eid="1CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2" />Kaha muli nakulihalesa! Nkuma kumuapandele kukala na vusiua ndi? Kaha uoshe uje nalingi eci vamuhumise hakati keni. <verse eid="1CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3" />Cipuevene nguavo kunjesi neni mu vuntu, vuno honi njili neni mu cimbembesi. Kaha nga kunjili, njinasompo laja, <verse eid="1CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4" />mu lizina lia Muene Yesu hali yala uje nalingi viuma evi. Omo mukunguluka hamo, kaha cimbembesi cange cili neni hamo na nzili ya Muene uetu Yesu, <verse eid="1CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5" />haneni ou yala kuli Satana linga anongese muvila uendi, ngeci cimbembesi cendi vakacovole ha litangua lia Muene Yesu. <verse eid="1CO 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6" />Kulihalesa ceni keti cacili, nkuma kumuzivuka ngueni cimbaluila cacindende casa kufutunuisa mukasha uoshe ndi? <verse eid="1CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7" />Humiseni cimbaluila calaja linga mupue mukasha uauha, ngue muje cilivene mumulimo vakuhona cimbaluila, muomu Kilistu ikeye napu muna mpanga ua Paseka yetu kaha vana mukombelela laja. <verse eid="1CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8" />Nankuma tuyeni tuvuahelele Ciuano eci, keti na cimbaluila calaja, cikeco cimbaluila ca vungungu na vupi, vuno honi na mbolo yakuhona cimbaluila ya kulela na vusunga. <verse eid="1CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9" />Njasonekele mu mukanda uange nguange yeni keti mukalehamo na vantu vaje vakakulinga vupangala, <verse eid="1CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10" />kunjilumbununa nguange vupangala vua hano ha mavu, cipue vaje vaka lizangamena na vezi, cipue vaje vaka kulemesa tumponia, ambahoni ha cuma eci yeni munapande kuhuma a mavu aua. <verse eid="1CO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11" />Vuno honi njimisonekela nguange keti mukalehamo na uoshe uje alitumbula ikeye liavenia nguendi muka kutsiliela nga ikeye ali na mulonga uakulinga vupangala cipue cipululu, cipue ikeye ali na kulemesa tumponia, muka kushaula, muka kupenda, cipue muizi. Keti mueseke cipue kulia na muntu uacifua eci. <verse eid="1CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12" />Nkuma vikahoni vinjilinga nga njisompa vaje vali hambanza? Nkuma keti vaje vali mukati ka cikungulukilo vakevo vamunapande kuvasompa indi? <verse eid="1CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13" />Njambi akasompo vaje vali hambanza. Ngue muje muvihandeka visoneka nguavio, “Humiseni uoshe uje muka vupi uje ali hakati keni.”<verse eid="1CO 5:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6" />
  <para style="s">Kulisompesa yeni vavenia ku Vinzango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1" />Muomu nga hakati keni hali umo alinienga hali munaina, nkuma napande kuya kuvaka lishiko vaje vaka kuhona kulela kupulakana kuya ku vantu vakulela va Njambi ndi? <verse eid="1CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2" />Nkuma kumuzivuka ngueni vantu va Njambi vakulela vakasompa mavu ndi? Kaha nga mavu vakasompa kuli yeni, kaha muhonoua vati kusompa vimpande via vindende? <verse eid="1CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3" />Nkuma kumuzivuka ngueni yetu tukasompa tungelo ndi? Kaha tukahonoua vati honi kusompa viuma vije viakundama ku vuyoye ovu! <verse eid="1CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4" />Nankuma nga muli na vimpande via cifua eci, nkuma vika mukavitualela kuli vaje kuvasingimikiua mu cikungulukilo? <verse eid="1CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5" />Njilinakuhandeka evi linga shuamua imikole. Nkuma hakati keni kukuesi yala ali na mana cikuma linga ase kusompa kulinienga cije cili hakati ka vaka kutsiliela ndi? <verse eid="1CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6" />Vuno honi muka kutsiliela atuala mukuavo muka kutsiliela ku lishiko mukulisompa kuli vaje vakakuhona kutsiliela?<verse eid="1CO 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7" />Cije cineha linga mulituale umo na mukuavo kuvaka lishiko cimuesa ngeci muahonoua. Nkuma vikahoni kumutavela linga vamipihisile? Nkuma vikahoni kumutavela linga vamikuise? <verse eid="1CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8" />Vuno honi yeni vavenia mukapihisa na kulikuisa, cipue kuli vamuanoko. <verse eid="1CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9" />Nkuma kumuzivuka ngueni vaka vupi ku vakasuana Vumuene vua Njambi ndi? Keti vamikuise, cipue vikuizi cipue vaka kulemesa tumponia cipue vaka kulinga vupangala cipue vamala vaka kulinga vukoyi na vakuavo vamala, <verse eid="1CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10" />cipue vaka kuiva cipue vaka lizangamena cipue vaka kupenda cipue vaka kushaula cipue mihuza navakevo kuva kasuana Vumuene vua Njambi. <verse eid="1CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11" />Kaha na hakati keni vamo muapuile ngue vakevo, vuno honi vamikushile na kumilelesa, vamipuisile vaka vusunga mu lizina lia Muene Yesu Kilistu na mu Cimbembesi ua Njambi yetu.<verse eid="1CO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pangeseni mivila yeni ku vumpau vua Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12" />Vuno honi muka handeka ngueni, “Viuma vioshe viapua via lishiko kuli yange,” vuno honi keti viuma vioshe vije viapua viaseho. Viuma vioshe viapua via lishiko kuli yange. Vuno honi yange kunjikapu nji ndungo ku cuma coshe. <verse eid="1CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13" />Kaha neni naua muka handeka ngueni, “Viakulia viapua via lizimo, kaha lizimo liapua lia viakulia.” Vuno honi Njambi akapihisa vioshe. Nankuma muvila kuvaupangelele kulinga vupangala vuno honi ukeuo vaupangelele Muene, kaha Muene vamupangelele muvila. <verse eid="1CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14" />Kaha Njambi uje uasanguile Muene ikeye naua akatusangula na nzili yendi. <verse eid="1CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15" />Nkuma kumuzivuka ngueni mivila yeni yapua vilio via Kilistu ndi? Nankuma njasa kuambata vilio via Kilistu na kuvipuisa vilio via cikoyi ndi? Houe! <verse eid="1CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16" />Nkuma ngeci kumuzivuka ngueni uoshe uje alipandakana ikeye vavenia na cikoyi apua muvila umo nendi ndi? Muomu ngue muje muvacisoneka nguavo, “Vavali vakapua muvila umo.” <verse eid="1CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17" />Vuno honi uoshe uje nalipandakana kuli Muene napu umo nendi mu Cimbembesi. <verse eid="1CO 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18" />Teueni ku vupangala. Kaha vupi voshe vueka vuje muntu a linga vunapu vua hambanza lia muvila uendi, vuno honi muntu uje alinga vupangala akalingi vupi ku muvila uendi vavenia. <verse eid="1CO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19" />Nkuma kuzivuka nguove muvila uove uapua njivo ya Njambi ya Cimbembesi ua kulela uje ali muli yove, uje yuli nendi kuhuminina kuli Njambi ndi? Kaha yeni kumuakundamene kuli yeni vavenia, <verse eid="1CO 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20" />yeni vamilandele na ndando. Nankuma singimikeni Njambi mu mivila yeni.<verse eid="1CO 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7" />
  <para style="s">Vihula viaha vulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1" />Honi kuya ku vimpande vije vimuasonekele, cacili kuli yala kuhona kulinga vupangala na mpuevo. <verse eid="1CO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2" />Vuno honi muomu ya vieseko via vupangala, kaha yala uoshe napande kukala na mpueyendi kaha naua na mpuevo uoshe napande kukala na yaliendi. <verse eid="1CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3" />Kaha yala napande kulinga vije via mupande kuli mpueyendi, kaha na mpuevo naua napande kulinga mumo vene kuli yaliendi. <verse eid="1CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4" />Muomu mpuevo kesi na nzili yakuyula muvila uendi vavenia, vuno honi kuvanga yaliendi, mu ngila imo vene yala kasa kuyula muvila uendi vavenia, vuno honi kuvanga mpueyendi. <verse eid="1CO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5" />Keti muli vianene umo na mukuavo, kuvanga nga mualitavasana ha cuma cimo linga mulihane yeni vavenia mukulombela, vuno honi munima yavio munapande kulipandakana hamo naua, kuteua Satana linga keti amieseke muomu yakuhona kuli hilula yeni vavenia. <verse eid="1CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6" />Njilinakuhandeka evi muku mitavesa, vuno honi keti ngue kumishika. <verse eid="1CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7" />Njitonda nguange ngue muva voshe muapua ngue muje munjili yange, vuno honi muntu uoshe ali na vuana vuamutela vuje vuhuma kuli Njambi, ou vueka kaha mukuavo vueka.<verse eid="1CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8" />Ku vazike na ku vantuluue njihandeka nguange cacili kuli vakevo kukala muje vene kuakuhona kuliambata ngue muje mu njilimo yange. <verse eid="1CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9" />Vuno honi nga kuvasa kulihilula vakevo vavenia kaha vanapande kuambata, muomu cacili kuambata kupulakana kukala nantuima ya mashungu.<verse eid="1CO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10" />Kuli vaje vaka kuliambata njili nakumishika, keti yange vuno honi Muene ngeci, mpuevo kapandele kulitepa na yaliendi, <verse eid="1CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11" />(vuno honi nga alitepa na yaliendi napande kukala muzike cipue kulihiluisa na yaliendi), kaha na yala kapandele kukondola mpueyendi. <verse eid="1CO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12" />Ku voshe njilinakuhandeka eci, keti Muene, nguange nga muanoko ali na mpueyendi uje keti uakutsiliela, kaha atava kukala nendi, kaha kapandele kumukondola.<verse eid="1CO 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13" />Nga mpuevo uoshe uje ali na yaliendi uakuhona kutsiliela, kaha atava kukala nendi kaha kapandele kumukondola. <verse eid="1CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14" />Muomu yala uje uakuhona kutsiliela vanamulelesa kuhitila muli mpueyendi, kaha na mpuevo uje uakuhona kutsiliela vanamulelesa kuhitila muli yaliendi. Keti ngoconi vana veni vakapua vakuhona kulela, vuno honi muje mucilimo vanapu vakulela. <verse eid="1CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15" />Vuno honi nga mukuavo uje uakuhona kutsiliela ashunguiya kulitepa, cifue ngocovene, kaha ha mulonga ou muka kutsiliela uje nakala hamo nendi cipue yala cipue mpuevo napatuka, muomu Njambi uatusanenene linga tuyoye mu ciyulo. <verse eid="1CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16" />Yove mpuevo nkuma uzivuka vati nguove uasa kuovola yaliove? Kaha nove naua yala nkuma uzivuka vati nguove uasa kuovola mpueyove?<verse eid="1CO 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoya ngue muje muaku sanenenemo Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17" />Muntu uoshe napande kuyoya vuyoye vuje Muene namuhana, kaha na muje Njambi namu sanenamo. Eli likelio lishiko liange mu vikungulukilo vioshe. <verse eid="1CO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18" />Nkuma muntu uoshe ualovokele laja ha ntsimbu ije ivamusanene ndi? Kaha keti ahumise cimueso cije cimuesa nguavo nalovoka laja. Nkuma kuli muntu uje tele kanda alovoke ha ntsimbu ije ivamusanene ndi? Nga kuali uangoco kaha keti alovoke. <verse eid="1CO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19" />Kulovoka ku cilumbununa cimo cipue kuhona kulovoka ku cilumbununa cimo, kuvanga lika kutulika mashiko a Njambi. <verse eid="1CO 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20" />Muomu muntu uoshe napande kukala mu ngila ije ivamusanene nayo kuli Njambi. <verse eid="1CO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21" />Nkuma yove uapuile undungo omo vakusanene ndi? Nankuma keti uhakeleko mana, vuno honi nga uasa kuuanamo kupatuka cove, kaha likuaseseco. <verse eid="1CO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22" />Muomu uoshe uje ivasanene muli Muene ngue ndungo ikeye napu muntu uakupatuka ua Muene. Kaha mu ngila imo vene uje uapuile uakupatuka omo vamusanene, ikeye napu ndungo ua Kilistu. <verse eid="1CO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23" />Vamilandele na ndando, ngeci keti mupue vandungo va vantu. <verse eid="1CO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24" />Nankuma vamuanetu, muntu na muntu napande kulitombola na Njambi, ngue muje muakele omo vamusanene.<verse eid="1CO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vihula viaha vazike na vantuluue</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25" />Honi kuya kuli vije vimuahandekele hali vazike, kunjesi na cimo cahi cinjishika cije cihuminina kuli Muene, vuno honi njihana viyongola viange ngue umo uje ha kuya ku cikeketima ca Muene napu muka vusunga.<verse eid="1CO 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26" />Njasinganieka nguange kuya ku vieseko vije vili nakulingiua hano, cacili kuli muntu kukala muje vene mualimo.<verse eid="1CO 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27" />Nkuma vakukutu ku mpueyove ndi? Kaha keti utonde kupatuka. Nkuma uapatuka kuli mpueyove ndi? Kaha keti utonde vulo. <verse eid="1CO 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28" />Vuno honi nga yala ambata kaha kalingi vupi, kaha nga mpuevo ashomboka kaha kalingi vupi. Vuno honi vaje vambata vakakala na makalu a hano ha mavu, vuno honi yange njitonda nguange keti mukale nauo.<verse eid="1CO 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29" />Vamuanetu vinjilumbununa evi, ntsimbu ije ivahanguile ili muyehi, nankuma kuhuma hano honi eceleni voshe vaje vanambata vayoye ngue kuvambatele, <verse eid="1CO 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30" />kaha na vaje vali navusiua vakale ngue kuvesi mu vusiua, na vaje vajolela vapue ngue kuvesi mu nzolela, kaha na vaje vakakulanda vapue ngue vaje kuvesi na viuma, <verse eid="1CO 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31" />kaha na vaje valina kupangela vufuko vua hano ha mavu, vapue ngue kuvavupangelele. Muomu viuma via hano ha mavu vikahiti lika. <verse eid="1CO 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32" />Njitonda nguange mupatuke kuvishoti, yala uakuhona kuambata ikeye ali na cishoti lika ha vipangi via Muene, muje vati asa kuvuaheleselamo Muene. <verse eid="1CO 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33" />Vuno honi yala uakuambata ikeye ali na cishoti ca viuma vije via hano ha mavu, muje vati muasa kuvuaheleselamo mpueyendi, <verse eid="1CO 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34" />Kaha viyongola viendi viapua via kuli hangununa. Kaha na mpuevo uje uakuhona kushomboka cipue uje kanda alimone na yala ikeye ali nacishoti ku vipangi via Muene, muje vati muasa kulelesa muvila uendi na cimbembesi, vuno honi mpuevo uakushomboka ikeye ali nacishoti ku viuma via hano ha mavu, muje vati muasa kuvuaheleselamo yaliendi.<verse eid="1CO 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35" />Njihandeka eci muomu ya kumikuasa, kunjitondo kumiteuesa. Vuno honi linga mukale mu ngila yacili ya kusungama ya kuhona lihangununo mukulihana kuli Muene.<verse eid="1CO 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36" />Kaha nga muntu umo asinganieka nguendi kesi nakulinga muacili kuli muna mpuevo uje ya nalama, kaha nga mashungu endi anapu akama cikuma, kaha napande kulinga muje muatondelamo, nankuma vanapande kuliambata ku valingi vupi. <verse eid="1CO 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37" />Vuno honi uoshe uje natambula eci mu mutima uendi, kuakuhonoua kumusindiya vuno honi asa kuendesa mashungu endi, mu kumuniunga kupua mpueyendi uje kanda alimone na yala kaha akalinga muacili. <verse eid="1CO 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38" />Nankuma uoshe uje ambata uje mpuevo kanda alimone na yala alinga muacili, vuno honi uje kamuambata alinga muacili cikuma.<verse eid="1CO 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39" />Mpuevo vanamukutu kuli yaliendi mu miaka yoshe ije yaliendi ayoya, nga yala atsa, napatuka kushomboka naua kuli yala uoshe uje yatonda, kuvanga lika kuli yala uje ali muli Muene. <verse eid="1CO 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40" />Vuno honi mukusompa cange ou mpuevo napu uakuvuahelela nga akala muje vene muali, kaha njasikanieka ngeci nange vene njili na Cimbembesi ua Njambi.<verse eid="1CO 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Cihula caha viakulia via kukombelela ku tumponia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1" />Honi kuya ha via kulia vije viakukombelela ku tumponia, tuzivuka nguetu, “Tuva voshe tuli namana.” Mana aje akalingisa muntu linga alihalese, vuno honi cizango cikeco cika tungisa. <verse eid="1CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2" />Nga kuli umo akasinganieka nguendi azivukako vimo, vuno honi kazivuka kuya muje muanapandele kuzivukilamo. <verse eid="1CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3" />Vuno honi nga uoshe uje azanga Njambi, ou vanamuzivuka muomu ya Njambi. <verse eid="1CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4" />Nankuma kuya ku kulia viakulia vije viakukombelela tumponia, tuzivuka nguetu kamponia cilivene kekuyoya, kaha kukuesi Njambi ueka naua vuno honi umo lika. <verse eid="1CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5" />Muomu cipue vene nga kuvali vaje vavasana nguavo, “vanjambi,” muilu cipue hano ha mavu, cilivene ngue muje mukuli “vanjambi” vavengi na “vimuene” vavengi, <verse eid="1CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6" />vuno honi kuli yetu kuli lika Njambi umo, Tatetu, kaha kuli ikeye kukeko kuahuma viuma vioshe, kaha muli ikeye mukemo tuyoyela, ikeye Muene umo lika, Yesu Kilistu, ikeye uje muli ikeye muli viuma vioshe kaha muli ikeye mukemo tuyoyela.<verse eid="1CO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7" />Vuno honi keti vantu voshe vazivuka mana aua, vuno honi vamo hanga vacili na cisemua cakulemesa tumponia, vakali viakulia vije vivana kombelela ku tumponia, kaha visinganieka viavo hakupua via kuzeya vinajuala. <verse eid="1CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8" />Viakulia kuviasa kutuneha kuyehi na Njambi, nacimo cahi casa kutukuasa cipue nga kutuvili, kaha nacimo cahi naua cituuanaho cipuevene tuvilie. <verse eid="1CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9" />Kaha zangameni lika kuteua eci kupatuka ceni linga keti cikapue citsuntsuiso kuli vaje vanazeye. <verse eid="1CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10" />Muomu nga muntu umo akumona, yove yala uje ua mana, uatumama ku mesa mu njivo ya tumponia, nkuma kasa kusimpa nga visinganieka viendi viazeye linga alie viakulia vije vivanakombelela ku tumponia ndi? <verse eid="1CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11" />Muomu ya mana ove kaha uje yala uakuzeya akanonga, muanoko uje muomu ya ikeye mukemo Kilistu uatsile. <verse eid="1CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12" />Kaha nga ulinga vupi kuli muanoko nakuvulumuna visinganieka viendi omo vinazeye, kaha uli nakulinga vupi kuli Kilistu. <verse eid="1CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13" />Nankuma nga viakulia vilingisa muanetu linga alinge vupi, kaha kunjikaliho ntsitu naua, kuteua njilingisa muanetu kuuila mu vupi.<verse eid="1CO 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9" />
  <para style="s">Kapandi na vipangi via kanganda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1" />Nkuma kunjapatukile ndi? Nkuma keti nji kanganda ndi? Nkuma kunjamuene Yesu Muene uetu ndi? Nkuma keti yeni vushuka vua vipangi viange muli Muene ndi? <verse eid="1CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2" />Nga honi kuveka keti yange kanganda, cilivene kuli yeni njinapu nji kanganda, muomu yeni munapu kasateso ka vunganda vuange muli Muene. <verse eid="1CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3" />Kaha eci cikeco kuliluila cange kuli vaje vanjeseka. <verse eid="1CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4" />Nkuma kutuesi nakapandi ha viakulia na viakunua ndi? <verse eid="1CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5" />Nkuma kutuesi nakapandi ka kutusindikiya kuli mpueyetu, ngue vakuetu tunganda na vamunaina ya Muene na Kefase ndi? <verse eid="1CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6" />Nkuma kuvanga yange na Mbanambase yetu lika vaje kuvesi na kapandi kakuhona kupangela vuyoye ndi? <verse eid="1CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7" />Nkuma iya akapanga ngue lisualale kaha alifueta ikeye vavenia? Nkuma iya akuna lihia lia mikolovozi cakuhona kulia ku vushuka vuayo? Nkuma iya akaniungu vampanga kuakuhona kunua mavele avo? <verse eid="1CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8" />Nkuma njili nakuhandeka evi na nzili yakama ya vuntu ndi? Nkuma lishiko kulihandeka evi vene viakulifua ndi? <verse eid="1CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9" />Muomu vanacisoneka mu lishiko lia Mosesa nguavo, “Keti mukute ngombe ku kanua omo alinakujungula vinona.” Nkuma Njambi nahakela lika mana vangombe ndi? <verse eid="1CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10" />Nkuma cilivene kekuhandeka evi vioshe omo yetu ndi? Vacisonekele muomu yetu nguavo, uoshe uje muka kulima napande kulima mu kutsiliela kaha na muka kujungula napande kujungula mu kutsiliela ku mutambela ua vimbuto viendi. <verse eid="1CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11" />Nga tunakunu vimbuto via Cimbembesi hakati keni, nkuma kucipu cuma cakama cikuma nga tuteja vuana vuje vuli muli yeni ndi? <verse eid="1CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12" />Nga kuli vamo vaje vali na vukuasi vuje vuhuminina kuli yeni, nkuma kutuesi navuo mu vuingi ndi?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 9:12">Cipue ngoco vene kutualikuaseseleko muacili aka kapandi. Vuno honi tunapande kuyanda mu viuma vioshe kupulakana kutanganesa Muzimbu Uacili ua Kilistu. <verse eid="1CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13" />Nkuma kumuzivuka ngueni vaje valina kupanga mu njivo ya Njambi vakauana viakulia viavo mu njivo ya Njambi, kaha na vaje vakapanga ha mutula vakalipangela nkombelo ije ivakankomelela ha mutula ndi? <verse eid="1CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14" />Mu ngila imo vene, Muene uashikile nguendi vaje vambulula Muzimbu Uacili vanapande kuuana vuyoye vuavo ku ukeuo.<verse eid="1CO 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15" />Vuno honi kunjalikuasesele cipue cimo kukapandi aka, kaha naua kunjesi nakusoneka eci linga aka kapandi kapue kange, muomu cacili njitse kupulakana kutavesa muntu uoshe kunjihumisa eci kulihalesa cange. <verse eid="1CO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16" />Muomu nga njambulula muzimbu uacili, cije cinjilinga yange linga keti njilihalese, muomu canjipande yange kuambulula, kaha cikafua vati vukalu kuli yange nga kunjambulula Muzimbu Uacili. <verse eid="1CO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17" />Muomu nga njilinga eci cuma muayilamo cizango cange, kaha njinatambula vuana, vuno honi nga keti muayilamo cizango cange, kaha vananjikundika cipangi eci. <verse eid="1CO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18" />Nkuma honi vuana vuange vuka? Hali eci muomu mukuambulula cange hamo njikapuisa Muzimbu Uacili kupua ua vuana vua kuhona ndando, kuakuhona kupangesa kapandi kange mukushula ku Muzimbu Uacili. <verse eid="1CO 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19" />Muomu cipuevene nguavo njapatuka kuli muntu uoshe, vuno honi njalipuisa yange vavenia ndungo ku voshe, linga njinganiale vantu vavengi. <verse eid="1CO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20" />Ku Vayunda njezile ngue nange nji Kayunda linga njivanganiale Vayunda, kaha kuli vaje vali vakava lishiko lia Mosesa njezile ngue uje akava lishiko lia Mosesa, vuno honi cipuevene yange kunjekukava lishiko lia Mosesa, vuno honi linga njivanganiale vaje vakava lishiko. <verse eid="1CO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21" />Kuli vaje kuvekukava lishiko lia Mosesa njezile ngue umo uje kekukava lishiko lia Mosesa, eci ku cilumbununa ngeci kunjekukava lishiko lia Njambi vuno honi njikakava lishiko lia Kilistu linga njinganiale vaje kuvekukava lishiko. <verse eid="1CO 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22" />Kuli vaka kuzeya njapuile muka kuzeya, linga njinganiale vaje vaka kuzeya. Kaha njinalipuisa viuma vioshe ku vantu voshe, linga njase kuovolako vamo. <verse eid="1CO 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23" />Njili nakulinga vioshe evi muomu ya Muzimbu Uacili, linga njiuaneko vikuisulo viamo. <verse eid="1CO 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24" />Nkuma kumuzivuka ngueni vaka kushatuka voshe vakaliluisa ndi? Vuno honi umo lika ikeye akatambula vuana, nankuma neni shatukeni linga mukatambule vuana. <verse eid="1CO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25" />Muka kuliluisa uoshe akalivuahesela mu viuma vioshe. Vaka cilingi linga vatambule cilongo cije ca kantsimbu lika, vuno honi yetu linga tukatambule cilongo ca yaye. <verse eid="1CO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26" />Nankuma yange kunjekushatuka muangoco, yange kunjekulua ngue uje muka kulua na vinkome uje apupa vinkome mu mpuzi, <verse eid="1CO 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27" />vuno honi yange njikakolesa muvila uange na vinkome naku upuisa ndungo yange linga munima ya kuambulula ku vakuetu, ngeci yange vavenia keti njikahonoue kuuana fueto.<verse eid="1CO 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Vinangulo via ha Tumponia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1" />Vamuanetu njitonda linga muzivuke nguange vakukuluila vetu voshe vakele muintsi lia lishelua, kaha voshe vahitile mu cisali. <verse eid="1CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2" />Kaha voshe va vambuitikile kuhitila muli Mosesa mu lishelua na mu cisali, <verse eid="1CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3" />kaha voshe valile viakulia via kulifua viaku cimbembesi, <verse eid="1CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4" />kaha voshe vanuine via kunua via kulifua viaku cimbembesi muomu vanuine mu Livue lia ku cimbembesi lije lia vakavangeyele, kaha lije Livue liapuile Kilistu. <verse eid="1CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5" />Cipue ngocovene Njambi kavuahelele ku vamo vavo kaha mivila yavo vayumbilile mu mpambo.<verse eid="1CO 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6" />Honi evi viuma vinapu cinangulo kuli yetu, keti tushunguiye vupi ngue muje muvalingile vakevo. <verse eid="1CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7" />Keti mulemese tumponia ngue muje muvalingile vamo vavo, ngue muje muvacisoneka nguavo, “Vantu vatumamene mu kulia na kunua kaha vemanene mukukina.” <verse eid="1CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8" />Kutuapandele kulinga vupangala ngue muje vamo vavo valingile, kaha voshe makulukazi makumi avali na atatu (23,000) vatsile litangua limo. <verse eid="1CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9" />Kutuapandele kueseka Muene, ngue muje muvalingile vamo vavo kaha voshe vavashumine ku manoka na kutsa. <verse eid="1CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10" />Kaha kutuapandele kulinienieta ngue muje mu valingile vamo vavo kaha vavanongesele kuli kangelo uje muka kutsiha.<verse eid="1CO 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11" />Honi viuma vioshe evi vialingiuile kuli vakevo kupua ngue cinangulo, vuno honi vavisonekele kupua ngue vishika kuli yetu, muomu tuli na kuyoya ku ntsimbu ya mamanusuilo.<verse eid="1CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12" />Nankuma nga kuli umo asinganieka nguendi asa kuimana ngoo kaha napande kuzangama linga keti aue. <verse eid="1CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13" />Nacimo cahi ceseko civamieseka naco cije keti ca mualolo kuli muntu. Njambi uapua uakulongua, kaha kamitavesa linga vamieseke vieseko vije vipulakana nzili yeni, vuno honi asa kumieseka na ceseko cije casa naua kumisholuela na ngila ije imuasa kuteuelamo, linga muase kuimana ngoo nalukakateya.<verse eid="1CO 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14" />Nankuma honi vamuanetu vanjazanga, teueni kulemesa tumponia. <verse eid="1CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15" />Njilinakuhandeka ngue ku vantu vaje vanananguka, kaha lisompeni yeni vavenia hali evi njili nakuhandeka. <verse eid="1CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16" />Nganja ya cikuisulo ije tukakuisula, Nkuma keti kulipandakana mu maninga a Kilistu ndi? Kaha nkuma na mbolo ije tukapazula, Nkuma keti kulipandakana mu muvila ua Kilistu ndi?<verse eid="1CO 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17" />Muomu kuakala lika mbolo imo, kaha netu vaje vavengi tunapu muvila umo lika, muomu tuvoshe tukali mbolo imo lika. <verse eid="1CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18" />Singaniekeni ha vantu va mu Isaleli, nkuma keti vakevo vaje valipangelele mu kulia vinkombelo via ha mutula ndi? <verse eid="1CO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19" />Nkuma vika njilumbununa honi? Nkuma via kulia vije vivakalambuila ku tumponia viasa kupua cakulia coshe, indi nkuma kamponia asa kupua cuma coshe ndi? <verse eid="1CO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20" />Houe, vuno honi njilinakuhandeka ngeci vinkombelo vivakalambuila vaje vaka kuhona kutsiliela vaka vilambuila ku mahamba keti kuli Njambi, kunjitondo nguange neni mukale hamo na mahamba. <verse eid="1CO 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21" />Kumuasa kunuina mu nganja ya Muene kaha naua na kunuina na mu nganja ya mahamba. Kaha kumuasa kulia ku mesa ya Muene kaha naua na kulia ku mesa ya mahamba. <verse eid="1CO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22" />Nkuma tuapande kulingisa Muene linga ovue cipululu ndi? Nkuma yetu tuvakukolesa kupulakana ikeye ndi? <verse eid="1CO 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23" />“Viuma vioshe viakala na lishiko,” Vuno honi keti viuma vioshe viapua viaseho. “Cilivene viuma vioshe viakala na lishiko,” Vuno honi keti viuma vioshe vikatungisa. <verse eid="1CO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24" />Muntu uoshe keti atonde vucili vuendi, vuno honi atonde vucili vua kavusamba kendi.<verse eid="1CO 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25" />Lieni vioshe vije vivalandesa ku cihela cakulandesela ntsitu kuakuhona kuihula kuje kuvihuminina linga mitima yeni keti imihise. <verse eid="1CO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26" />Muomu visoneka vihandeka nguavio, “Mavu apua a Muene, na viuma vioshe vije vilimo.”<verse eid="1CO 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27" />Nga umo ua vaje vakakuhona kutsiliela amilania ku kulia ca cinguezi, kaha mutonda kuya, lieni vioshe vije vivana mivuahesela cakuhona kuihula cihula ca kuje kuvihuminina linga mitima yeni keti imihise. <verse eid="1CO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28" />Vuno honi nga muntu umo ahandeka kuli yeni nguendi, “Evi vanavilambula kupua nkombelo.” kaha honi keti uvilie muomu ya mulonga ua uje uakulekele, na mulonga uavisinganieka viove. <verse eid="1CO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29" />Evi kuviapuile visinganieka viove vavenia houe, vuno honi visinganieka via muntu uje nakuleka umo ehula nguendi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 10:29">Muomu vika honi kupatuka cange cakulinga vioshe vije njitonda vanacivindika muomu ya visinganieka via muntu ueka? <verse eid="1CO 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30" />Kaha nga njiitsantsela oku njilia, nkuma vati honi vahandeka hali yange viuma via vipi muomu yakuhana citsantsela kuli Njambi ndi?<verse eid="1CO 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31" />Nkuma cipue mulia cipue munua, cipue vioshe vimulinga, vilingeni vioshe ku vumpau vua Njambi. <verse eid="1CO 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32" />Keti muhane mulonga kuli Vayunda cipue kuli Vangelengu cipue ku cikungulukilo ca Njambi, <verse eid="1CO 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33" />ngue muje munjili nakueseka kuvuahelesa vantu mu viuma vioshe vinjili nakulinga, kunjekutonda vucili vuange vavenia lika, vuno honi vucili vua vavengi, linga vase kuovoka.<verse eid="1CO 10:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1" />Njitemunuiseni ngue muje yange munjikatemunuisa Kilistu.<verse eid="1CO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kufuika ku mutue mu kulemesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2" />Njimishangazala yeni muomu mukanjivuluka mu viuma vioshe nakutualelaho kukavangeya vilongesa ngue muje vene munja mihanenevio. <verse eid="1CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3" />Vuno honi njitonda muvuisise ngeci mutue ua yala uoshe uapua Kilistu, kaha mutue ua mpuevo uapua yaliendi, kaha mutue ua Kilistu uapua Njambi. <verse eid="1CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4" />Kaha yala uoshe uje alombela cipue ahandeka vunanguizi oku nafuiki ku mutue uendi, kasingimikile mutue uendi. <verse eid="1CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5" />Vuno honi mpuevo uoshe uje alombela cipue ahandeka vunanguizi cakuhona kulifuika ku mutue uendi kasingimika mutue uendi, mucifua cimo vene vinkambu viendi ngue vanavitehula. <verse eid="1CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6" />Vuno honi nga mpuevo kafuiki ku mutue uendi, kaha napande kutehula vinkambu viendi, vuno honi nga cinapu cashuamua kuli mpuevo kulitehula vinkambu viendi, kaha napande kufuika ku mutue uendi. <verse eid="1CO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7" />Muomu yala kapandele kufuika mutue uendi, omo ikeye uapua cifua na vumpau vua Njambi, vuno honi mpuevo uapua vumpau vua yala. <verse eid="1CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8" />Muomu yala kuvamutangele kuhuminina kuli mpuevo, vuno honi mpuevo vamutangele kuhuminina kuli yala. <verse eid="1CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9" />Muomu yala kuva mutangelele mpuevo, vuno honi mpuevo vamutangelele yala. <verse eid="1CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10" />Omu mukemo mpuevo napande kufuika ku mutue uendi muomu ya tungelo. <verse eid="1CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11" />Cipue ngocovene, muli Muene mpuevo kalimanena likaliendi kuakuhona yala kaha cipuevene yala kalimanena likaliendi kuakuhona mpuevo. <verse eid="1CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12" />Muomu ngue muje mpuevo vamutangele kuhuma hali yala, mucifua cimovene yala ikeye honi nasemuka kuli mpuevo. Kaha viuma vioshe viahuminina kuli Njambi. <verse eid="1CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13" />Lisompeni yeni vavenia, nkuma cacili mpuevo kulombela kuli Njambi oku kalifuikile ku mutue ndi? <verse eid="1CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14" />Nkuma keti cisemua ca viuma cikeco camilongesa yeni ngeci nga yala ali na vinkambu vialaha evuisa shuamua, <verse eid="1CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15" />vuno honi nga mpuevo ali na vinkambu vialaha, nkuma keti cikeco kulihalesa cendi ndi? Muomu vinkambu viendi vamuhanavio kupua kulifuika cendi. <verse eid="1CO 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16" />Nga muntu uoshe atualelelaho lutue kulinga vimpata, kutuesi na cisemua ceka naua, cipue mu vikungulukilo via Njambi.<verse eid="1CO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mesa ya Muene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-29">Mateu 26:26-29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-25">Mako 14:22-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17" />Vuno honi ha vishika vimo kunjimishangazala, muomu yeni nga muliuana hamo kaha kuliuana ceni kucekupua cacili vuno honi cakupihisa. <verse eid="1CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18" />Cakulivanga, omo muliuana hamo hakupua cikungulukilo, njilinakuivua ngeci kuli mahangununo hakati keni, kaha njili nakucitsiliela. <verse eid="1CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19" />Cilivene hanapande kukala lihangununo hakati keni linga vavazivukileho vaje vali na vusunga. <verse eid="1CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20" />Kaha omo muliuana hamo, keti ngue muli nakulia mesa ya Muene. <verse eid="1CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21" />Kaha omo muli na kulia, muntu na muntu ali nakuya kulutue na via kulia viendi, kaha mukuavo natsi njala mukuavo ikeye napende. <verse eid="1CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22" />Vika honi! Nkuma kumuesi na vinjivo via kulilamo na via kunuinamo ndi? Cipue nkuma muka sembulula cikungulukilo ca Njambi nakuvuisa shuamua vaje kuvesi na cimo ndi? Nkuma vika honi njikahandeka kuli yeni? Nkuma njimishangale mu cuma eci ndi? Houe kunjilingimo.<verse eid="1CO 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23" />Muomu vije vinjatambuile kuli Muene vikevio vije njamihanene yeni, ngeci Muene Yesu ha vutsiki vuje omo vamuendele vungungu uambatele mbolo, <verse eid="1CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24" />kaha hanima yakuhana citsantsela, uayipazuile nakuhandeka nguendi, “Ou ukeuo muvila uange uje uvanamihana yeni, kaha lingeni eci mukunjivuluka.” <verse eid="1CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25" />Mu ngila imo vene uambatele nganja naua hanima ya kulia mbolo kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Eyi nganja inapu litavasano lialiha mu maninga ange. Lingeni eci ntsimbu yoshe omo munuinamo mukunjivuluka.” <verse eid="1CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26" />Muomu ntsimbu yoshe muli na kulia eyi mbolo na kunuina mu nganja eyi, kaha mukulinga eci muli nakuhana vukaleho vua kutsa ca Muene noho akeja. <verse eid="1CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27" />Nankuma uoshe uje alia mbolo cipue anua ku nganja ya Muene kuakuhona kasingimiko ali na mulonga ua upi uakuluisa muvila na maninga a Muene. <verse eid="1CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28" />Eceleni muntu uoshe alihilule ikeye vavenia, ntsimbu kanda alie mbolo na kunuina mu nganja. <verse eid="1CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29" />Muomu muntu uoshe uje alia na kunua cakuhona kuzivuka muje vika uje muvila ua Kilistu ualia na nganja ije yanuina muvilumbunuka, kaha alinehela kusompa hali ikeye vavenia. <verse eid="1CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30" />Omu mukemo vuingi vueni muazeye na kuvavala, kaha vamo vanatsi. <verse eid="1CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31" />Vuno honi nga tulisompa yetu vavenia mu vusunga, kaha kuvapandele kutusompa. <verse eid="1CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32" />Vuno honi nga vanatusompo kuli Muene, kaha vanatuhaka mu ngila ya cili linga keti vatuhisile hamo na vaka mavu. <verse eid="1CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33" />Nankuma vamuanetu nga muliuana hamo mu kulia mesa ya Muene, livandameneni umo na mukuavo, <verse eid="1CO 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34" />nga kuli umo natsi njala napande kulila ku njivo yendi, linga honi omo muliuana hamo keti linga vamihise, kaha ha viuma vikuavo njikahana vishika omo njikeja.<verse eid="1CO 11:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Mavuana akuhuma ku Cimbembesi Uakulela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1" />Vamuanetu kuya ha mavuana a cimbembesi, kunjitondo linga mukale kunzimba. <verse eid="1CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2" />Muazivuka ngeci omo muapuile vaka kuhona kutsiliela, kaha vintsimbu viavingi vamitanganesele na kumizimbalesa ku tumponia vatuveveve. <verse eid="1CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3" />Nankuma njitonda nguange muzivuke ngueni naumo uahi uje asa kuhandeka mu Cimbembesi ua Njambi evi nguendi, “Yesu asingiue!” kaha naumo uahi naua asa kuhandeka nguendi, “Yesu ikeye Muene,” kuakuhona Cimbembesi Uakulela.<verse eid="1CO 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4" />Vuno honi kuli mavuana akuliseza seza, honi Cimbembesi uapua umo lika ikeye muka ku ahana. <verse eid="1CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5" />Kaha kuli vipangi viakuliseza seza, vuno honi Muene uapua umo lika. <verse eid="1CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6" />Kaha kuli muakupangela muakuliseza seza, vuno honi Njambi umo lika ikeye akavituamenena vioshe kuli uoshe.<verse eid="1CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7" />Ku muntu na muntu vanamuhana vukaleho vua Cimbembesi muomu ha viuma viacili. <verse eid="1CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8" />Ku umo vanamuhana kuhitila mu Cimbembesi ca muzimbu ua mana, kaha mukuavo vanamuhana mangana kuya ku Cimbembesi uje vene ua kulifua. <verse eid="1CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9" />Ueka vanamuhana lutsilielo kuli Cimbembesi uakulifua, kaha mukuavo vanamuhana vuana vua kukanguisa kuli Cimbembesi ujevene umo lika. <verse eid="1CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10" />Kaha ku mukuavo vanamuhana vinzili via vikomoueso, mukuavo vanamuhana kuambulula vunanguizi, mukuavo vanamuhana mana akunongonona vifua via vimbembesi, kaha mukuavo vanamuhana kuhandeka mu vindaka via kuli sezaseza, kaha naua ueka vanamuhana kulumbununa vindaka. <verse eid="1CO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11" />Kaha viuma vioshe evi vavituamenena ku Cimbembesi umo lika uakulifua, kaha uavipangelele kuli umo na umo, kuya muje muatondelamo.<verse eid="1CO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muvila umo ua vilio viavingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12" />Muomu ngue muje vene muvila uapua umo lika kaha uakala na vilio viavingi, kaha vilio via muvila vioshe cipuevene viapua viavingi, vuno honi viapua muvila umo lika, kaha mukemo vene mucafua na Kilistu. <verse eid="1CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13" />Muomu ha Cimbembesi umo tuva voshe vatumbuitikile mu muvila umo lika, Vayunda cipue Vangelengu, vandungo cipue vaka kupatuka kaha tuva voshe vatuhanene kunua ku Cimbembesi umo lika.<verse eid="1CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14" />Muomu muvila ku uakele lika na cilio cimo vuno honi viavingi. <verse eid="1CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15" />Nga ciliato cihandeka nguaco, “Muomu kunjapuile nji livoko, kaha kunjakundamene ku muvila,” Eci keti cikeco casa kulingisa nguavo cimo cavio keti cipue cilio ca muvila. <verse eid="1CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16" />Kaha nga lituitui lihandeka ngualio, “Muomu kunjapuile lisho, kaha kunjakundamene ku muvila.” Eci keti cikeco casa kulingisa ngeci cimo cavio keti cipue cilio ca muvila. <verse eid="1CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17" />Nga muvila uoshe uapuile lisho, kaha ngue ukevuila kuli? Kaha nga muvila uoshe uapuile lituitui, kaha ngue ukevuila kuli kunika? <verse eid="1CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18" />Vuno honi ngue muje mucilimo, Njambi uavuahesele vilio vioshe via mu muvila, cimo na cimo kuya muje muatondelelemo. <verse eid="1CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19" />Kaha nga vioshe viapuile cilio cimo, kaha ngue muvila uli kuli? <verse eid="1CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20" />Ngue muje mucilimo viapua vilio viavingi, vuno honi muvila umo.<verse eid="1CO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21" />Kaha lisho kuliasa kuhandeka ku livoko ngualio, “Kunjesi nove naseho,” Cipuevene mutue kuhandeka ku ciliato nguauo, “Kunjesi nove naseho,” <verse eid="1CO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22" />Mu ngila ikuavo naua, vilio via muvila vije vikamoneka ngue viakuzeya kutuasa kupanga cuma coshe kuakuhona vikevio. <verse eid="1CO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23" />Kaha vilio via muvila vije tusinganieka nguetu kuviesi na seho cikuma vikevio tukaniungu cikuma na seho. Kaha vilio vije kuvie kusholoka ku vantu vikevio tukaniungu cikuma na seho, <verse eid="1CO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24" />vilio vietu vije vikasholoka ku vantu kutuekutonda kuviniunga cikuma na seho, vuno honi Njambi uanungakanene muvila kaha uahana kasingimiko kakama cikuma ku vilio vije kuviakele na seho, <verse eid="1CO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25" />linga keti muvila ulihangunune, vuno honi linga vilio viliniunge muakulifua kuli cimo na cikuavo. <verse eid="1CO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26" />Nga cilio cimo ciyanda, kaha vilio vioshe viyandela hamo, nga cilio cimo vacisingimika, kaha vilio vioshe vivuahelela hamo.<verse eid="1CO 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27" />Honi yeni munapu muvila ua Kilistu kaha muntu uoshe napu cilio ca muvila ou. <verse eid="1CO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28" />Njambi mu cikungulukilo ha kulivanga uahanguile tunganda, kaha kuhilukilaho tunanguizi, kaha luamucitatu valongisi, ambahoni vaka kulinga vikomoueso, kuhatakanako vaka kukanguisa, kaha na vakuasi, na vaka kutuamenena, kaha na vaka kuhandeka mu vindaka via kuliseza seza. <verse eid="1CO 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29" />Nkuma voshe vapua tunganda ndi? Nkuma voshe vapua tunanguizi ndi? Nkuma voshe vapua valongisi ndi? Nkuma voshe vakalingi vikomoueso ndi? <verse eid="1CO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30" />Nkuma voshe vali na mavuana a kukanguisa ndi? Nkuma voshe vakahandeka mu vindaka ndi? Nkuma voshe vaka lumbununa ndi? <verse eid="1CO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31" />Vuno honi na mitima yeni yoshe tondeni mavuana aje aseho cikuma,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 12:31">Kaha hanga naua vene njikamimuesa cije ca cili cikuma kuma.<verse eid="1CO 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Cizango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1" />Kaha nga njihandeka mu vindaka via vantu cipue na via tungelo, vuno honi kunjesi na cizango, kaha njinapu lika ngue kutenda ca ngongi cipue kuohia ca ngenzo. <verse eid="1CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2" />Kaha nga njili na nzili ya vunanguizi, na kuvuisisa vushueke vuoshe na mana oshe, kaha nga njili nalutsilielo luoshe luje luasa kuhumisa minkinda, vuno honi kunjesi na cizango kaha njinapu uangoco. <verse eid="1CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3" />Kaha nga njihana vioshe vije njili navio, kaha naua nga njilihana muvila uange linga vautsimike, vuno honi kunjesi na cizango kaha nacimo cahi cinjiuanaho.<verse eid="1CO 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4" />Mu cizango muakala kusimpa na ngozi, mu cizango kumuakele cipululu kaha naua mu cizango kumuakele kulihalesa cipue kulivua. <verse eid="1CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5" />Mu cizango kumuakele kushaula, mu cizango kumuakele kulizanga yove vavenia, cipue kuniengua, mu cizango kumuakele nkulundundu. <verse eid="1CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6" />Mu cizango kumuakele kuvuahelela ha viuma via vupi, vuno honi muakala kuvuahelela ha viuma via vusunga. <verse eid="1CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7" />Mu cizango muakala kuliniunga, mu cizango muakala lutsilielo ku viuma vioshe, mu cizango muakala kutsiliela viuma vioshe, kaha muakala lukakateya ku viuma vioshe.<verse eid="1CO 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8" />Mu cizango kumuakele kuhonoua, vuno honi vunanguizi vukahita lika, nakuhandeka mu vindaka kuoshe kukahua, kaha na mana nauo akahita lika. <verse eid="1CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9" />Muomu mana etu ku azivuka vioshe kaha na vunanguizi vuetu kutue kuhandeka vioshe mukushula, <verse eid="1CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10" />vuno honi omo viakushula vikeja, kaha vije via kuhona kushula vikahua.<verse eid="1CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11" />Omo njapuile nji kanike, njakale nakuhandeka ngue kanike, njakele nakusinganieka ngue kanike, njakele nakulinga viuma ngue kanike, vuno honi omo njakolele kupua yala njalikelele kulinga viuma via vuanike. <verse eid="1CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12" />Muomu hano honi tulinakumona lika viuma ngue tuli nakavimona muka likengelo, ambahoni tukamona mesho na mesho. Kaha vije njazivuka hano vinapu viavindende, vuno honi njikevuisisa muakushula, cipuevene njavivuisisa laja mukushula.<verse eid="1CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13" />Nankuma lutsilielo, na kutsiliela na cizango, ha viuma evi vitatu vuoshe, vuno honi cakamaho hali evi vioshe capua cizango.<verse eid="1CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14" />
  <para style="s">Mavuana akuavo naua a Cimbembesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1" />Kavangeyeni ngila ya cizango na kushunguiya cikuma mavuana a cimbembesi, cikuma kuma mavuana a kunangula vunanguizi. <verse eid="1CO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2" />Muomu uoshe uje ahandeka mu vindaka kekuhandeka ku vantu vuno honi akahandeka kuli Njambi, muomu naumo uahi asa kumuvuisisa, vuno honi ahandeka viuma via vushueke mu Cimbembesi. <verse eid="1CO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3" />Vuno honi uje ahandeka vunanguizi akahandeka ku vantu mu kuvakolesa naku vasimpisa na kuvazembeleka. <verse eid="1CO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4" />Uje uoshe akahandeka mu vindaka akalikuasa ikeye vavenia lika, vuno honi uje muka kuhandeka via vunanguizi ikeye akakuasa cikungulikilo.<verse eid="1CO 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5" />Honi njitonda linga muva voshe muhandeke mu vindaka, vuno honi cakama cikuma njitonda nguange muhandeke vunanguizi. Uje ahandeka vunanguizi ali cikuma na seho kupulakana uje ahandeka mu vindaka, kuvanga nga kuli umo uje alumbununa vije viahandeka, linga vikuase cikungulukilo coshe. <verse eid="1CO 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6" />Honi vamuanetu nga njija kuli yeni oku njihandeka mu vindaka, nkuma honi njikamikuasa vati kuvanga mpamo njiminehele kusholola cimo cipue mana cipue vunanguizi cipue vilongesa.<verse eid="1CO 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7" />Nga cipuevene viakuimbisa vije viakuhona muono vije ngue mbendo cipue kalialia, nga kuviohio muacili, nkuma muntu asa kuzivuka vati vije vivemba? <verse eid="1CO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8" />Kaha nga tolombita kuyohio muacili, nkuma iya honi asa kuli vuahesela nzita? <verse eid="1CO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9" />Mucifua cimo vene neni naua nga muhandeka mu vindaka vije kuvivuika, nkuma vati honi muntu umo asa kuzivuka vije muhandeka? Muomu mukahandekela lika mu mpunzi. <verse eid="1CO 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10" />Cilivene hano ha mavu hali miyati yaingi ya kuliseza, vuno honi yoshe ili naseho. <verse eid="1CO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11" />Vuno honi nga kunjizivuka muje vije viulumbununa uje muyati, kaha njikapua nji mungezi kuli uje ahandeka kaha na uje ahandeka akapua mungezi kuli yange. <verse eid="1CO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12" />Mu ngila imovene neni naua muomu muli nakutonda cikuma vije viahandeka cimbembesi, asekeneni kutonda mavuana aje atunga cikungulukilo.<verse eid="1CO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13" />Nankuma, uje ahandeka mu vindaka napande kulomba nzili ya kulumbununa. <verse eid="1CO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14" />Muomu nga njilombela mu vindaka, cimbembesi cange cilombela vuno honi mana ange ali kuvieka. <verse eid="1CO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15" />Nkuma njikalinga vika honi? Njikalombela mu cimbembesi cange kaha naua njikalombela mu mana ange, kaha njikemba mu cimbembesi cange kaha naua njikemba mu mana ange. <verse eid="1CO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16" />Keti ngoconi nga mushangazala Njambi na cimbembesi, nkuma vati honi muntu uje ahuminina kueka ahandeke nguendi “Ameni” ku kutsantsela ceni? Muomu ikeye kazivuka vije muli nakuhandeka. <verse eid="1CO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17" />Muomu yeni muasa kuhana citsantselo ceni muacili cikuma, vuno honi veka kucivakuasa cipue cimo.<verse eid="1CO 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18" />Njitsantsela kuli Njambi ngeci njikahandeka mu vindaka cikuma kupulakana yeni voshe. <verse eid="1CO 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19" />Vuno honi lika mu cikungulukilo njapande kuhandeka lika mezi atanu mu mana ange ngeci njituamenene vakuetu kupulakana kuhandeka mezi makulukazi likumi (10,000) mu vindaka.<verse eid="1CO 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20" />Vamuanetu, keti mupue ngue vanike mukusinganieka ceni, pueni tukeke mu viuma via vipi, vuno honi kusinganieka ceni cipue ca vukuluntu. <verse eid="1CO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21" />Vana visoneka mu visoneka nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="1CO 14:21">Muene nahandeka nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">“Kuhitila mu vantu vakuhandeka vindaka via vungenzi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 14:21">Na kuhitila mutunua tuavangenzi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">Mukemo njikahandeka ku vantu ava,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 14:21">vuno honi cipue ngoco kuvakanjivuila.”<verse eid="1CO 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22" />Kaha kuhandeka mu vindaka keti cimueso ca vaka kutsiliela vuno honi ca vaka kuhona kutsiliela, kaha vunanguizi keti vua vakakuhona kutsiliela vuno honi vua vaka kutsiliela.<verse eid="1CO 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23" />Nankuma nga cikungulukilo coshe cilikunguluila hamo na kuhakandeka mu vindaka, kaha vantu veka cipue vakakuhona kutsiliela omo vakovela, nkuma kuvakahandeka nguavo muazaluka ndi? <verse eid="1CO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24" />Vuno honi nga voshe vahandeka vunanguizi, kaha uje muka kuhona kutsiliela cipue muntu uje ahuminina kueka akovela, voshe vakatsiliela nguavo vaka vupi muomu yavije vivanovu kaha naua voshe vaka vasompa muomu yavije vivanovu, <verse eid="1CO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25" />kaha vushueke vua mutima uendi vaka vusholola, kaha akatsikama ha mavuli nakulemesa Njambi, nakulitavela nguendi, “Muavusunga Njambi ali hakati keni!”<verse eid="1CO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kasingimiko mu Cikungulukilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26" />Vamuanetu nkuma vika honi tukahandeka? Omo mukaliuana hamo kaha umo na umo ueni ali na muaso, mukuavo ali na cilongesa, mukuavo ali na kusholola, mukuavo ali na kuhandeka mu vindaka, cipue mu kulumbununa, kaha viuma vioshe evi vavilinge mu kukuasa cikungulukilo. <verse eid="1CO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27" />Nga muntu umo ahandeka mu vindaka, kaha kukale vavali cipue vatatu vahandeke kaha umo na umo napande kuhandeka ha ntsimbu yendi, kaha umo alumbunune. <verse eid="1CO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28" />Vuno honi nga kukuesi umo uje alumbununa kaha voshe vanapande kuholoka mu cikungulukilo, kaha napande lika kuhandeka kuli ikeye vavenia na kuli Njambi. <verse eid="1CO 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29" />Aceleni vavali cipue vatatu tunanguizi vahandeke, kaha vakuavo vanapande kuhilula vije vivali nakuhandeka. <verse eid="1CO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30" />Kaha nga kusholola vanacimuesa kuli mukuavo uje natumama kuyehi, kaha uje muka kuhandeka uakulivanga napande kuholoka. <verse eid="1CO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31" />Muomu muva voshe muasa kuhandeka vunanguizi umo na umo, linga voshe valilongese na kulikolesa. <verse eid="1CO 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32" />Kaha vimbembesi via tunanguizi viakala muintsi lia tunanguizi. <verse eid="1CO 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33" />Muomu Njambi keti Njambi uampindangano vuno honi uapua ua ciyulo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 14:33">Ngue muvikungulukilo vioshe via vantu vakulela va Njambi, <verse eid="1CO 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34" />vampuevo vanapande kuholoka mu vikungulukilo. Muomu kuvavatavesele kuhandeka vuno honi vanapande kuononoka ngue muje mulihandeka lishiko. <verse eid="1CO 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35" />Nga kuli vimo vije vashunguiya kuzivuka, vanapande kuihula va yaliavo ku vinjivo viavo. Muomu cinapu cuma ca shuamua cikuma mpuevo kuhandeka mu cikungulukilo.<verse eid="1CO 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36" />Nkuma lizi lia Njambi lihuma kuli yeni ndi? Cipue nkuma kuli yeni lika liezile ndi? <verse eid="1CO 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37" />Nga uoshe asinganieka nguendi ikeye napu kananguizi, cipue ali na vuana vua cimbembesi, napande kunanguka ngeci evi vinjili nakusoneka kuli yeni vinapu lishiko lia Muene. <verse eid="1CO 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38" />Kaha nga muntu kazivukile evi, kaha nendi naua kuva kamuzivuka.<verse eid="1CO 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39" />Nankuma vamuanetu, shunguiyeni kuhandeka vunanguizi, vuno honi keti mu vindike vaje vahandeka mu vindaka. <verse eid="1CO 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40" />Vuno honi viuma vioshe viapande kulingiua muacili na muje muviayilamo.<verse eid="1CO 14:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15" />
  <para style="s">Kusanguka ca Kilistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1" />Honi vamuanetu njimivulukisa nguange mucifua muka muje njambuluile kuli yeni Muzimbu Uacili, uje umuatambuile, uje umunemana nauo mu lutsilielo, <verse eid="1CO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2" />uje umunovoka nauo, nga mukakateya ku lizi lije njambuluile kuli yeni. Keti ngoconi muatsiliela muangoco.<verse eid="1CO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3" />Muomu vije njatambuile njavihanene kuli yeni kupua via kulivanga via seho, ngeci Kilistu uatsililile vipi vietu, kuya muje mu vihandekelamo visoneka, <verse eid="1CO 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4" />nguavio vamutsindile, kaha vamusanguile ha litangua lia mucitatu kuya muje mu vihandekelamo visoneka, <verse eid="1CO 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5" />kaha ngeci uasholokele kuli Kefase, ambahoni kuli vaje likumi na vavali. <verse eid="1CO 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6" />Ambahoni naua uosholokele kuli vamuanetu vavengi kupulakana vihita vitanu (500) a ntsimbu imo lika, vamo vavo vacili nakuyoya, vuno honi cipuevene vamo vanatsi. <verse eid="1CO 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7" />Ambahoni uosholokele kuli Yakomba, naua na ku tunganda voshe.<verse eid="1CO 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8" />Kaha ha kumanusuila ku viuma vioshe ambahoni uasholokele na kuli yange naua uje uasemukile vuvishu. <verse eid="1CO 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9" />Muomu yange njinapu uamundende ku tunganda, uje kafuila kumutumbula kanganda, muomu yange njapakesele cikungulukilo ca Njambi. <verse eid="1CO 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10" />Vuno honi muomu ya kavumbi ka Njambi mukemo njili muje munjilimo, kaha kavumbi kendi hali yange kukapuile kangoco. Cipue ngoco, njapangele cikuma kupulakana voshe, cipuevene keti yange, vuno honi kavumbi ka Njambi kaje kali nange. <verse eid="1CO 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11" />Cipuevene nguavo yange cipue vakevo, nankuma yetu tuambuluile kaha yeni honi muatsilielele.<verse eid="1CO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusanguka ca vatsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12" />Honi nga Kilistu vamuambulula nguavo vamusanguile ku vatsi, nkuma kuija vati ngeci vamo veni vahandeka nguavo kukuesi kusanguka kuvatsi? <verse eid="1CO 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13" />Vuno honi nga kukuesi kusanguka ku vatsi, kaha ngue Kilistu kuvamusanguile. <verse eid="1CO 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14" />Nga Kilistu kuvamusanguile, ambahoni kuambulula cetu cinapu ca ngoco kaha na lutsilielo lueni lunapu lua ngoco. <verse eid="1CO 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15" />Kaha tunauaniua nguetu kutuesi nakuimanena Njambi muacili, muomu tuahanene vukaleho vua Njambi ngeci uasanguile Kilistu, nga cilivene vatsi kuvakasanguka kaha na Njambi vene kasanguile Kilistu. <verse eid="1CO 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16" />Muomu nga vatsi kuvakasanguka, kaha na Kilistu naua kuvamusanguile. <verse eid="1CO 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17" />Nga Kilistu kuvamusanguile, kaha lutsilielo lueni lunapu luangoco kaha hangavene mucili mu vipi vueni. <verse eid="1CO 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18" />Ambahoni na vaje naua vanatsila muli Kilistu vananongo. <verse eid="1CO 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19" />Nga muomu ya vuyoye ovu lika tunatsiliela muli Kilistu, kaha hali voshe, yetu vanapande kutuvuila cikuma ngozi.<verse eid="1CO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20" />Vuno honi muavusunga vene Kilistu vamusanguile ku vatsi, ikeye uakulivanga kusanguka ku vatsi. <verse eid="1CO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21" />Muomu kuhitila mu muntu mukemo kutsa cezile, kaha muli muntu naua mukemo muhuminina kusanguka ca vatsi. <verse eid="1CO 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22" />Muomu kuhitila muli Andama vantu voshe vatsa, mucifua cimovene naua kuhitila muli Kilistu vantu voshe vakayoya. <verse eid="1CO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23" />Vuno honi umo na umo akasanguka kuya mungila yendi, Kilistu ikeye vua kulivanga kusanguka ku vatsi, ambahoni hakuija cendi kaha vaje vanakundama kuli ikeye navo naua vakasanguka. <verse eid="1CO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24" />Ambahoni kukeja mamanusuilo, muomu Kilistu akahana vumuene kuli Njambi Tate hanima yakunongesa vaka kuyula vahano ha mavu, na nzili yakama yoshe na nzili. <verse eid="1CO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25" />Muomu napande kuyula kuvanga noho nahaka vitozi viendi voshe muintsi lia viliato viendi. <verse eid="1CO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26" />Kaha citozi ca kumanusuila kunongesa cikapua kutsa. <verse eid="1CO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27" />Muomu Njambi nahaka viuma vioshe linga vipangele muintsi lia viliato viendi, vuno honi muomu visoneka vihandeka nguavio “Viuma vioshe navihaka linga vipangele muintsi liendi,” Calimuesa cilivene ngeci kucakundamene kuli Njambi, uje aka viuma vioshe muintsi lia Kilistu. <verse eid="1CO 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28" />Omo viuma vioshe vanavihaka kuli ikeye, ambahoni na muana ikeye vavenia akalihana kuli Njambi uje nahaka viuma vioshe muintsi liendi, linga Njambi apue cuma coshe kuli muntu uoshe.<verse eid="1CO 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29" />Honi nkuma vantu valumbununa vika omo vavambuitika nguavo kuimanene vatsi? Nga vatsi vakevo kuva kasanguka, Nkuma vati vantu vavambuitika mukuvemanena? <verse eid="1CO 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30" />Nkuma vika njili mu makalu ntsimbu yoshe? <verse eid="1CO 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31" />Vamuanetu njilina kuluisa kulihalesa cange hali yeni cije njili naco muli Kilistu Yesu Muene uetu, njikatsi ha litangua na litangua! <verse eid="1CO 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32" />Nkuma vika njiuanaho nga njihandeka mu vuntu nguange, njaluile na vikashama ku Efeso, nga vakakutsa kuvakasanguka, “Kaha tuyeni tulie na kunua muomu imene tutsa.”<verse eid="1CO 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33" />Keti vamikuise “Omo vantu vavapi vakapihisa visinganieka viacili.” <verse eid="1CO 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34" />Hilukeni kuvisinganieka vieni via cili, kaha keti mukalingeho vupi naua, omo vamo kuvesi na mana a Njambi njihandeka eci na shuamua yeni.<verse eid="1CO 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mivila ije ivakasanguka nayo vantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35" />Vuno honi umo akehula nguendi, “Nkuma vakakutsa vaka vasangula vati? Nkuma na mivila yacifua muka ije vakeja nayo?” <verse eid="1CO 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36" />Yeni vantu vavilema vije mukuna ku viekuija ku muono kuvanga noho vinatsi. <verse eid="1CO 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37" />Kaha vije vimukakunu keti ikeyo nona ije ikakalako, vuno honi nona, cipue ya tiliku cipue nona kualukele. <verse eid="1CO 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38" />Vuno honi Njambi akahana vinona kuya muje muanahanguilamo, kaha ku nona na nona na cifua cayo.<verse eid="1CO 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39" />Muomu keti mivila yoshe yapua ya kulifua, vuno honi kuli umo uacifua ca vuntu, ukuavo ua cifua ca tusitu ukuavo ua tuzila kaha na ukuavo ua vantsi.<verse eid="1CO 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40" />Kaha kuli mivila ya muilu na mivila ya ha mavu, vuno honi vumpau vua muilu vuapua vumo lika, kaha vumpau vua ha mavu vuapua vueka naua. <verse eid="1CO 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41" />Kuli kuviakuma ca litangua, kaha kuli kuviakuma ca ngonde, kaha kuli naua kuviakuma ca vintanga ntanga, muomu ntanga ntanga ya liseza ku ntanga ntanga ikuavo mu kuviakuma cavio.<verse eid="1CO 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42" />Nankuma omu mukemovene mucinafu na kusanguka ca vatsi. Omo cije civanakunu cikanonga, vuno honi cije civanasangula kucikanongo. <verse eid="1CO 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43" />Omo muvila vaka utsindi kua kuhona kasingimiko na kuzeya, kaha vakausangula mu vumpau na nzili. <verse eid="1CO 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44" />Vakautsindi oku ucili muvila ua vuntu, vuno honi vakausangula oku uli mu cimbembesi, kaha nga kuli muvila ua vuntu, kaha kuli na muvila ua cimbembesi naua. <verse eid="1CO 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45" />Nankuma vacisoneka muvisoneka nguavo, “Yala uakulivanga Andama, uapuile muntu uakuyoya,” vuno honi Andama uamamanusuilo uapuile cimbembesi uakuhana muono. <verse eid="1CO 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46" />Keti via ku cimbembesi viapua via kulivanaga, vuno honi via vuntu, ambahoni via ku cimbembesi. <verse eid="1CO 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47" />Muntu uakulivanga uahumininine a mavu, muntu uakuhuma ku mpumputa, kaha muntu uamucivali uahumine muilu. <verse eid="1CO 15:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48" />Ngue muje uapuile muntu ua kuhuma ku mpumputa, mukemo vene muvanafu na vaje vahuma ku mpumputa, kaha ngue muje naua muanafu muntu uje uakuhuma muilu, mukemo vene muvanafu na vaje vahuma muilu. <verse eid="1CO 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49" />Ngue mujevene mutunasemuka ku cifua ca muntu uje uahumine ku mpumputa, mukemo vene naua tukakala na cifua ca muntu uje uahumine muilu.<verse eid="1CO 15:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50" />Vamuanetu njimileka evi nguange muvila na maninga kuviasa kusuana Vumuene vua Njambi, mucifua cimovene cipue cuma cije casa kunonga kucasa kusuana cuma cije kucenonga.<verse eid="1CO 15:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51" />Taleni, njilinakumileka vushueka, tuva voshe kutukatsi, vuno honi tuva voshe vakatuhimpula. <verse eid="1CO 15:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52" />Mukantsimbu lika ngue muje mulikakemuna lisho, ha tolombita ya mamanusuilo. Muomu tolombita ikohia, kaha vatsi vaka vasangula, kuakuhona kunonga naua, kaha vaka tuhimpula. <verse eid="1CO 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53" />Muomu muvila ou uakunonga unapande kuzala uje uakuhona kunonga, muomu muvila ou ua kutsa unapande kuzala uje uakuhonoua kutsa. <verse eid="1CO 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54" />Omo cije cakunonga nga cizala cije cakuhonoua kunonga kaha cije cakutsa nga cizala cije cakuhona kutsa ambahoni cilishulisise kuhandeka cije civanasoneka nguavo, “Kutsa vanacimanusula mu kuhiana!”<verse eid="1CO 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55" />“Tala kutsa, nkuma kuhiana cove cili kuli?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 15:55">Tala kutsa, nkuma vusungu vove vuli kuli?”<verse eid="1CO 15:55" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56" />Vusungu vua kutsa vuapua vupi, kaha nzili ya vupi yapua lishiko lia Mosesa. <verse eid="1CO 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57" />Vuno honi tutsantsela kuli Njambi uje akatuhana kuhiana kuhitila muli Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu.<verse eid="1CO 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58" />Nankuma vamuanetu vanjazanga, imaneni ngo kuakuhona kulininganga. Ntsimbu yoshe pangeni na nzili mu vipangi via Muene, oku muzivuka ngueni vipangi vieni vije muli nakupanga muli Muene kuviyi muangoco.<verse eid="1CO 15:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16" />
  <para style="s">Mulambu uakukuasa vaka kutsiliela vaje vanajena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1" />Honi kuya ha kukuasa vantu vakulela va Njambi, ngue muje munjashikilile vikungulukilo viaku Ngalatiya, neni vene mukemo munapande kulinga. <verse eid="1CO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2" />Lia calumingu na calumingu, umo ku umo ueni napande kutulikako cuma cimo kumukulo, ngue muje mumunaselamo, linga omo njikeja keti kukakale naua kutonda via vukuasi. <verse eid="1CO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3" />Kaha omo njiheta, njikatuma vaje vamunahangula na mikanda linga vakambate vuana vueni nakuvutuala ku Yelusalema. <verse eid="1CO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4" />Nga cimuesa ngeci nange naua njinapande linga njiyeko, kaha njikaya hamo navo.<verse eid="1CO 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matumbe a Paulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5" />Njikamimeneka hanima yakuhita mu Masendoniya, muomu yange njinapande kuhita mu Masendoniya, <verse eid="1CO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6" />kaha njikakala neni cipue ku ntsimbu ya cisika, linga honi mukanjikuase muvuasi mu vungezi vuange kuoshe kuje kunjikaya. <verse eid="1CO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7" />Muomu kunjitondo kumimona lika na kumihitilila houe, vuno honi njatsiliela kukala neni mu vintsimbu, nga Muene acitavesa.<verse eid="1CO 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8" />Vuno honi njikakala mu Efese noho ha litangua lia Pantekosita. <verse eid="1CO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9" />Muomu Njambi nanjishokuelela cikolo cakama cakupanga vipangi viacili, kaha vavengi valina kunjiluisa.<verse eid="1CO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10" />Omo Timateo akeja, munapande kumutambula muacili hakati keni, muomu ali nakupanga vipangi via Muene, ngue yange. <verse eid="1CO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11" />Nankuma keti kukale umo amuyengule, mukuaseni mu vuasi mu vungezi vuendi mu ciyulo, linga ahiluke kuli yange, muomu njamuvandamena hamo na vamuanetu.<verse eid="1CO 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12" />Kaha hali muanetu Apolo, ntsimbu yoshe njikamusindiya cikuma linga akeje nakumimeneka hamo na vamuanetu vakuavo, tele keti cizango cendi kuija vuavuno vene, vuno honi akeja omo akauana ntsimbu.<verse eid="1CO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mezi amamanusuilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13" />Taleleni, imanene ngo mulutsilielo lueni, pueni vaka kusimpa, pueni vaka kukolesa. <verse eid="1CO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14" />Eceleni vioshe vije vimulinga muvilinge mu cizango.<verse eid="1CO 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15" />Vamuanetu honi muazivuka ngueni, ntanga ya Setefanase ikeyo yapuile ya kulivanga kutenguluka mu Akaya, Kaha valihana vakevo vavenia kuvipangi via vantu vakulela va Njambi, <verse eid="1CO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16" />kaha njimilambelela ngeci mukave vantu ava na kuli vaka kupanga vakuavo na vaka kuhundangana hamo navo.<verse eid="1CO 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17" />Njavuahelele cikuma hakuija ca Setefanase na Fotunatase na Akaikase, muomu vakevo vanapumo mukunjikuasa omo yeni muvahiko. <verse eid="1CO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18" />Muomu vanavuahelesa cimbembesi cange, neci ceni naua. Vantu vangacije vanapande kuvavuluka naua.<verse eid="1CO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19" />Vikungulukilo via ku Asiya viatuma vihindu. Akuila na Pilisila, hamo lika na cikungulukilo ca mu njivo yavo, vanamimeneka muli Muene. <verse eid="1CO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20" />Vamuanetu vanamimeneka. Lihinduiseni umo na mukuavo na kulitsemba ca kulela.<verse eid="1CO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21" />Yange Paulu njili nakusoneka vihindu evi na livoko liange vavenia.<verse eid="1CO 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22" />Nga uoshe kesi na cizango hali Muene, vamusinge! Muene uetu Ija! <verse eid="1CO 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23" />Kavumbi ka Muene Yesu kakale neni.<verse eid="1CO 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24" />Cizango cange cikale neni mu va voshe muli Kilistu Yesu. Amen.<verse eid="1CO 16:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16" />
</usx>